      "level": 1,
      "topic": "travel",
      "title_zh": "这儿是哪儿？",
      "title_en": "Where am I?",
      "paragraphs": [
        ["上", "个", "月", "，", "我", "一", "个", "人", "去", "上海", "。", "有", "一", "天", "，", "我", "想", "去", "看", "一", "个", "老", "地方", "。"],
        ["我", "走", "了", "一", "个", "小时", "，", "还是", "没有", "找到", "。"],
        ["我", "问", "一", "个", "老人", "：", "“", "这儿", "是", "哪儿", "？", "”"],
        ["他", "看", "了", "看", "我", "的", "手机", "，", "说", "：", "“", "不对", "，", "不", "是", "这儿", "。", "你", "走", "错", "了", "！", "”"],
        ["他", "跟", "我", "一起", "走", "了", "一会儿", "，", "我们", "就", "到", "了", "。", "我", "说", "：", "“", "谢谢", "您", "！", "”"]
      ],
      "translations": [
        "Last month I went to Shanghai on my own. One day I wanted to go and see an old part of town.",
        "I walked for an hour and still couldn't find it.",
        "I asked an old man: “Where am I?”",
        "He looked at my phone and said: “No, it’s not here. You’ve gone the wrong way!”",
        "He walked with me for a little while, and then we were there. I said: “Thank you!”"
      ],
      "names": ["上海"],
      "new_words": ["这儿", "哪儿", "不对"],
      "glossary": [
        { "word": "这儿", "english": "here" },
        { "word": "哪儿", "english": "where" },
        { "word": "不对", "english": "wrong; not right" },
        { "word": "上海", "english": "Shanghai" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "2026-10-27-s2",
      "level": 1,
      "topic": "business & finance",
      "title_zh": "为明年准备",
      "title_en": "Saving for next year",
      "paragraphs": [
        ["明年", "我", "想", "去", "中国", "玩", "。", "我", "要", "准备", "很", "多", "钱", "。"],
        ["现在", "，", "我", "早上", "六", "点", "就", "起床", "，", "去", "上班", "。", "晚上", "八", "点", "回家", "。"],
        ["中午", "，", "我", "吃", "我", "早上", "做", "的", "饭", "。"],
        ["一", "个", "月", "，", "我", "能", "少", "花", "五百", "块", "。", "这些", "钱", "我", "都", "不", "花", "。"],
        ["朋友", "问", "我", "：", "“", "你", "累", "不", "累", "？", "”", "我", "说", "：", "“", "有些", "累", "，", "也", "很", "高兴", "！", "”"]
      ],
      "translations": [
        "Next year I want to go to China. I need to save up lots of money.",
        "Now I get up at six in the morning and go to work. I get home at eight in the evening.",
        "At lunchtime I eat the food I made in the morning.",
        "That way I spend five hundred kuai less a month. I don’t touch that money.",
        "My friend asked me: “Aren’t you tired?” I said: “A bit tired — but happy too!”"
      ],
      "names": [],
      "new_words": ["明年", "起床", "中午"],
      "glossary": [
